{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119261","id":3632557251,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7YhGzD","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119261","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119261.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119261.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119261","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119261/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119261/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119261/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/0df87711d262d46edf1ceef1c100f2718fac2959","number":119261,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add unit tests for `TextureButton`","user":{"login":"calbebop","id":70987281,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwOTg3Mjgx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70987281?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop","html_url":"https://github.com/calbebop","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/calbebop/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Contributes to #43440\r\n\r\nAdds unit tests for `TextureButton` covering:\r\n\r\n* Default property values (all texture slots, click mask, `ignore_texture_size`, `stretch_mode`, flip flags, `mouse_filter`, combined minimum size)\r\n* Set/get and clear for each texture slot, plus independent slots (`texture_normal` / `texture_pressed`, etc.)\r\n* Click mask set/get and clear\r\n* Combined minimum size priority (`texture_normal` over `texture_pressed` / `texture_hover`, `texture_pressed` when normal is empty, `texture_hover` when normal and pressed are empty, mask-only when no textures)\r\n* `ignore_texture_size` with a normal texture (combined minimum size stays zero)\r\n* All `StretchMode` enum values round-trip\r\n* `flip_h` / `flip_v` toggling and independence\r\n* `has_point` without a click mask (via `Control*`; `TextureButton` keeps `has_point` protected)\r\n* `has_point` with a click mask after `NOTIFICATION_DRAW`: default keep stretch, `STRETCH_SCALE`, `STRETCH_TILE` (including a second horizontal tile), and `STRETCH_KEEP_ASPECT_COVERED`\r\n\r\nAI disclosure: I designed the test plan, wrote every line, reviewed behavior, `has_point` access rules, and ran pre-commit and CI on my fork. Cursor helped with research and drafting.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2231593685,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMjMxNTkzNjg1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:tests","name":"topic:tests","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akie